The `callbacks` array elements for the `VIRTIO_BALLOON_VQ_STATS` and `VIRTIO_BALLOON_VQ_FREE_PAGE` queues were left uninitialized (set to `NULL`), which could lead to undefined behavior when these uninitialized pointers were read in the `find_vqs()` function, potentially affecting the calculation of the required MSI-X vectors.

