callbacks[VIRTIO_BALLOON_VQ_STATS] = NULL;
callbacks[VIRTIO_BALLOON_VQ_FREE_PAGE] = NULL;
```
Reason:
By explicitly setting the `callbacks` array elements corresponding to unavailable features to `NULL`, the code ensures that these pointers are not uninitialized. This prevents any undefined behavior when the `find_vqs()` function reads these pointers, thus ensuring correct calculation of the number of MSI-X vectors required.

